  "notes": [
    "The user-supplied Estes atlas and its companion JSON are copied unchanged and used directly for the champion animation.",
    "Official Default skill icons are sourced from the linked Estes Fandom page; the enhanced Skill 1 icon is preserved as an unbound reference asset.",
    "Skill 2 uses only the final-size lower-row frames from the supplied six-cell zone sheet; the three larger/smaller stage samples are deliberately excluded so the ring never expands.",
    "Moon-top crescent and moon-back aura are separate assets/bindings. Moon top is static; moon back is a subtle four-frame loop.",
    "Hit animation is derived from death frames 2,3,4,3,2,1 and is not a supplied hit sheet.",
    "Skill 1 and Ultimate tethers use the transparent tether artwork in native view effects. The sprite atlas contains 12 directional variants, refreshed from live caster/ally positions every two ticks; no projectile-pulse or debug-line renderer is used. In-game visibility remains to be verified."
  ]
